mapping "W3151.1" source="W3151" target="15185003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3151 = Swedish 6-char extension of ICD-10 W31 SNOMED CT 15185003 sub-classified by place=
        (shop/trade/service area) and activity= (play and other leisure). Base ICD-10 W31 (45756284) has
        Athena edge to SNOMED CT 4035493 (15185003). The Swedish extension adds place+activity granularity
        that has no SNOMED CT standard representation (no SNOMED CT concept combines machinery-contact with
        shop/leisure context). Target 4035493 fully subsumes the source (every such case is a contact
        with machinery), so mapping_type is broader. Confidence (low): crosswalk-verified ancestor but
        the place/activity axes are entirely dropped, a real specificity loss.
        """
}
mapping "W3152.1" source="W3152" target="15185003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3152 = Swedish extension of W31 with place=SNOMED CT 15185003 and activity= (paid work).
        Base W31 maps to SNOMED CT 4035493 (15185003) via Athena crosswalk. No SNOMED CT concept exists for
        machinery contact in a shop/service context during paid work. Target subsumes source (broader);
        the work/shop axes are lost. Confidence : crosswalk-verified ancestor, but two specificity axes
        dropped.
        """
}
